## 3. Brand Assets, 3D Models & Physical Product Designs (All Rights Reserved)

All brand assets, visual media, 3D binary models, and physical product designs are **All Rights Reserved** and are NOT licensed under the MIT License or open-source terms:

- **Trademarks & Brand Identity**: The names "Unstitch", "Unstitch Studio", "House of Tiles", and all logos, wordmarks (`logo-full.svg`, `logo-mark.svg`), mascots (`mascot.svg`), and brand graphics (`src/assets/`, `public/assets/`).
- **3D Binary Models**: 3D GLTF/GLB models (`public/Textile.glb`, `public/Textile-Components.glb`, and any associated mesh geometries).
- **Product Photography & Renderings**: Product imagery, collection renders, and mockups (`public/*.png`).
- **Proprietary Module & Bag Designs**: The physical mechanical die-cut interlocking patterns, dimensions, and specifications for Unstitch bag collections ("Modular Tote", "Bucket Bag", "Origami Clutch", "Crescent Moon", "DIY Tile Builder Kit", "Weekender").

No right is granted to use Unstitch trademarks or proprietary product designs for any commercial or public purpose without explicit written consent.

